    "created_at": "2019-11-11T16:55:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-11-11T19:01:15Z",
    "body": "I think this might be an observable interop issue. See https://boom-bath.glitch.me/autofocus-range.html which prints selectionStart and selectionEnd after autofocus.\r\n\r\n- Firefox Windows: (0, 0)\r\n- Chrome Windows: (0, 0)\r\n- Chrome Mac: (0, 0)\r\n- Safari Mac: (0, 7)\r\n- Firefox Mac: (0, 0)\r\n\r\nIt seems this is just a Safari bug, as far as I can tell.",
